      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Atlassian</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Meta</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Team Chat with Channels &amp; Presence (Slack / Teams)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Learn how one message typed into a channel of 50,000 people reaches every open laptop in about half a second, how the green \"online\" dot works for tens of millions of users without melting the servers, and why Slack moved from \"one database shard per company\" to \"shard by channel\" - well enough to drive a 45-minute interview.</p>\n      "
